      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> OverrideDefaultRoles <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Diagnostics.pdf#nameddest=SWS_DM_01141\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Diagnostics.pdf)\">[SWS_DM_01141]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/FO/AUTOSAR_FO_RS_Diagnostics.pdf#nameddest=RS_Diag_04251\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_FO_RS_Diagnostics.pdf)\">RS_Diag_04251</a></span></h3>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_ClientAuthenticationHandle_f03a02.html\">ClientAuthenticationHandle</a> &gt; OverrideDefaultRoles (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Vector_53b788.html\">ara::core::Vector</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_ClientAuthentication_f83028.html#SWS_DM_01134\">DiagnosticAuthRole</a> &gt; defaultRoles, <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/duration\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::chrono::milliseconds</a> timeout) noexcept;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This method is used by the application to temporarily change the default AuthenticationRole for a Diagnostic Server Instance. The diagnostic services allowed in the passed defaultRoles are now accessible to the tester for a time period defined in the parameter timeout.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
